#========================================================================

- title: Persistence via MS edge DLL load
  description: Hijack a DLL loaded by MS edge by modifying the
    DLL path in the registry. False positives are possible but unlikely.
  category: [persistence, registry, msedge]
  author: emryll
  score: 30

  components:
    - type: registry
      conditions:
        path:
          - 'HKLM\System\CurrentControlSet\Services\Winsock2\Parameters\NameSpace_Catalog5\Catalog_Entries64\000000000007\LibraryPath'

  response: alert

#========================================================================


